Ogail
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 104 DEAL SOUR
SOUR 0 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE SOUR SOUR
OR
    AND
        SRC Rank 1
        DEST Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS, CLUBS}
    DEST Suit {SPADES, CLUBS}
MOVE_STACK SOUR SOUR
SRCSTACK Rank equal
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL SOUR Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL SOUR Empty
